`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Your current spend controls were set when chat and Cowork were separate, and a member started in one or the other. With unified Claude, every conversation starts in the same place and moves into agentic work when the task calls for it."}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Pricing stays usage-based, so what you spend depends on how your members use Claude. That means you're budgeting for one mix of chat and agentic work, shaped by the tasks your members bring. Depending on the task, agentic work can use more tokens than a quick chat. Claude Enterprise admins have controls for managing this usage. Now is the time to revisit your controls with that in mind."}),`
