`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"A good starting point is to look at what could shift after the move. For example, you can look at how much your organization spends on Claude, how that spend is spread across your members, how agentic the work is, what the spend is going toward, and whether anyone is reaching a spend limit. You'll have questions of your own too. Understanding what you can see is what lets you decide where your controls need to change, and where they don't."}),`
