`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Choosing the amount for a spend limit is a trade-off. A lower one keeps spend close to plan and can pause members partway through work they rely on Claude for. A higher one keeps work moving and lets spend build before you've looked at what it's going toward. Usage can go slightly over a limit before it pauses. Use what you saw in your data to choose the amount for each group's spend limit."}),`
